## Host-built SPA output. wwwroot/js/ng and the Areas/User/Apps dist are
## generated by "npm run build" on the host and are gitignored, but COPY . .
## still sends them into the image, where their stale chunk filenames collide
## with the in-image SPA build and fail StaticWebAssets compression with
## "asset ... can not be found". The image builds its own copy.
**/wwwroot/js/ng
**/Areas/User/Apps/dist
**/Areas/User/Apps/node_modules
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
